# Inkling 2 Mini SC117 abliterated, Basalt NVFP4-MX8: the RTX 5090 default
# since 2026-11-25 (Max; docs/reports/DECISIONS-2026-11-25.md §7), replacing
# the stock pack (profile inkling2-mini-stock, kept: the rollback).
#
# The weights: SC117's abliteration (SC117/Inkling-2-Mini-abliterated-Strata @
# ae324ac3: the refusal direction projected out of attn.wo_ud of layers 4-23,
# nothing else) moved into thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini @ b85c3cfa and
# converted by Basalt's own converter: file
# Inkling-2-Mini-SC117-abliterated-NVFP4-MX8.basalt, sha256 6eaa50d3…9b,
# 19,606,374,187 bytes, pinned in scripts/weights.registry as a "derived" row.
# There is no download: build it offline with
# scripts/engines/inkling-sc117-pack.sh (docs/INSTALL.md). It differs from the
# stock pack only in the 20 Q8_0 tensors blk.{4..23}.attn_output.weight.
#
# The serve args and agent setup of the measured row INK-T2-SC117 (campaign
# arm I_T2_sc117, 51/71 scored, SCORE 75.3, single seed; INK-T2-STOCK's arm
# exactly): basalt serve --alias inkling-2-mini --parallel 1
# --max-context 262144 --kv fp8, DSpark at the pack default, answer room auto.
# Report: docs/reports/V5_INKLING2_MINI_SC117-2026-11-25.md.
#
# NOT exactly that row: the BUILD. INK-T2-SC117 ran the unpatched pin (so that
# only the weights differed from INK-T2-STOCK); this profile serves the pin
# plus the PR #632 patch, per DECISIONS-2026-11-24 §11 ("whenever we serve
# Inkling 2 Mini on Basalt"), as inkling2-mini-stock does. No board row has
# measured pin + #632 with these args on this pack either (on the stock pack,
# INK-T3 bundled it with other changes). Change it, PATCHES and MEASURED_ROW
# here, with the arm that measured them, never in the adapter. The launch
# refuses a build whose patches differ from PATCHES.
#
# Parsed by scripts/engines/basalt.sh (KEY=VALUE, never sourced).
PACK=Inkling-2-Mini-SC117-abliterated-NVFP4-MX8.basalt
SERVED_MODEL_NAME=inkling-2-mini
PARALLEL=1
MAX_CONTEXT=262144
KV=fp8
ANSWER_ROOM=auto
# The agent setup measured with it (scripts/lib/conf.sh _ob_profile_set).
AGENT_PROFILE=inkling-best
# The board row whose serve args and agent setup these are
# (evals/boards/v5/board.json); its build was the unpatched pin (above).
MEASURED_ROW=INK-T2-SC117
# The local patches the serving build must carry, exactly ('none' = the pin).
PATCHES=basalt-pr632-55f9be17.patch
